.TH GENETREE 1 2000-1月 "write_report" "write_report"
.SH NAME
write_report \- Export the training report as two readable table files.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIwrite_report(\fBreport\fR as <generic> TrainingReport, 
\fBfolder\fR as string);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Export the training report as two readable table files.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBreport\fB \fR\- the [TrainingReport](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.GeneTree.TrainingReport) object returned by the \fBfit_tree\fR api.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBfolder\fB \fR\- 
 the output directory: the \fBreport.tsv\fR(fitting quality of each gene model) and
 the \fBimportance.tsv\fR(split importance of each regulator) files are written
 into this directory, it will be created if it is not exists.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
TRUE when the table files have been written.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
geneTree
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
